=99s scoring against Lecce with a vintage effort. Two days after of his 28t=
h birthday, Pulisic ran beyond the defense and settled the aerial ball with=
 his right foot, quickly ushering it to his left for a breakneck finish bey=
ond the goalkeeper. It was his first league goal for the club in 2026. Whil=
